          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">EEG + fMRI + 自主神经信号同时指向同一结论，而不是单一模态自证。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="870.6959842519685" height="37.44" topLeftX="44.639999999999986" topLeftY="371.52" type="text" id="bDk">
