          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(15, 58, 87, 1)" fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">判据：如果模型在 conscious condition 下能稳定重建内容，而在 unconscious condition 下明显下降，才更可能说明解码信号与 conscious access 相关。</span></strong></p>
        </content>
