        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(234, 242, 248, 1)" fontSize="13" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">普通 BCI 可以用行为结果作为 ground truth；意识 BCI 恰恰面临 ground truth 缺失——这是它比普通 BCI 难的根本原因。</span></strong></p>
        </content>
